# This directory must exist in a fresh clone, even though its only occupant is
# generated and ignored.
#
# @spiriit/vite-plugin-svg-spritemap writes _sprite.scss in here on every build, and
# build/scss/mixins/_icon.scss @use's it. The plugin will not create the directory —
# it opens the file for writing and fails with ENOENT if the path is not there — so
# without this placeholder a clean checkout cannot build at all. That is exactly how
# the 2026-09-13 deploy broke: untracking the generated file took the last tracked
# file out of this directory with it, and git does not carry empty directories.
